 ## Step 7 — Dry-run (1–2 weeks), then live
 
 ```bash
-# config/policy.json: "mode": "dry-run"   → draft PRs labelled do-not-merge
+# config/policy.json: "mode": "dry-run"   → "[DRY RUN]" draft PRs labelled do-not-merge
